{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copy the Mona Lisa! With a mouse! In three minutes! &quot;That's impossible,&quot; you say?! Yes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But wait! There's more! You get:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 4-6 colors! \ud83d\ude42</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f 3 brush sizes! Medium, big, and too big! \ud83d\ude10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeab No undo! \ud83d\ude21</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeab No fill! \ud83e\udd2c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf A score based on every pixel you paint! \ud83d\udcaf \ud83d\ude02</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u25c7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Practice your skills by brutally butchering iconic masterpieces in one of the few drawing games that measures accuracy pixel-by-pixel in real-time. </i>\ud83e\udee0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u2500\u25c7\u2500\u25c7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/9b10acceabad131ca6789ea33f3b4cb3.poster.avif?t=1770594044\" width=182 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/9b10acceabad131ca6789ea33f3b4cb3.webm?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/9b10acceabad131ca6789ea33f3b4cb3.mp4?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/03bc3b0a4b86b340d1dc450f7d13e933.poster.avif?t=1770594044\" width=182 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/03bc3b0a4b86b340d1dc450f7d13e933.webm?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/03bc3b0a4b86b340d1dc450f7d13e933.mp4?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/d2434acd1faa5127d8a6d0af161f2380.poster.avif?t=1770594044\" width=182 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/d2434acd1faa5127d8a6d0af161f2380.webm?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/d2434acd1faa5127d8a6d0af161f2380.mp4?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/cc03eddd86939ba3a87d7b41f101ba25.poster.avif?t=1770594044\" width=182 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/cc03eddd86939ba3a87d7b41f101ba25.webm?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/extras/cc03eddd86939ba3a87d7b41f101ba25.mp4?t=1770594044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have an art degree and are thinking, &quot;Now what?&quot; Or  can't draw, but want to laugh at bad art with friends? Well, grab a mouse, choose from 30+ meticulously abstracted paintings from art history and get to <i>work</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARTY MODES!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-v-Mouse Local Multiplayer!?!</strong> Have <i>two</i> mice laying around? No? Well tell your friends it's BYOM and go head-to-head on the same computer. \ud83d\udc2d\ud83d\udc2d*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer.</strong> Use a join code to play with up for four friends online. \ud83c\udf0d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Modifiers.</strong> Play with absurd modifiers like: &quot;Baby Brush,&quot; &quot;From Memory,&quot; and  &quot;X, Y Flip.&quot; \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four-Mouse Crazy Collaborative Mode.</strong> Have <i>four</i> mice laying around?! Enough ports? Probably not, but <i>it'd be a lot cooler if you did.</i> 'Cause you could go 2v2, two people per canvas. \ud83d\udc2d\ud83d\udc2d\ud83d\udc2d\ud83d\udc2d*</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PAINTING FEATURES!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assist Tools.</strong> Use time-limited tools to help you spot differences (e.g., pins, grids) \ud83d\udccd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Feedback.</strong> See an accuracy bar go up and down as you paint. \ud83d\udcc8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard Shortcuts.</strong> Get all hackery and use keyboard shortcuts for <span class=\"bb_strike\">everything</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">most things</span>, some things. \u2328\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pretty Music.</strong> Listen to 8+ randomly-selected fast-paced piano songs that end dramatically to keep you focused. It even messes up sometimes. Like you. \ud83c\udfb9</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER MODE!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painting Archive.</strong> View a collection of every forgery you make in-game (stored locally). \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards.</strong> Compete for the best accuracy score per-painting and view a gallery of the best forgeries in-game. \ud83d\udcca</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Lapse  Replays.</strong> Relive each stroke of your masterpiece via time lapse replays. \ud83d\udd01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share performances.</strong> Download and share replays as animated GIFs.\u00a0\ud83d\udce4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode.</strong> Have some ideas, but not 100% what form this will take.\u00a0\ud83d\udc64</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Windows Only </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3030560?t=1770594044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770594044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/cef76f035bcbf584679bdb29e64c37a99ffcfa3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770594044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030560/cef76f035bcbf584679bdb29e64c37a99ffcfa3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770594044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copy the Mona Lisa! With a mouse! In three minutes! &quot;That's impossible,&quot; you say?! Yes.</strong></p><p class=\